alues of λ, the\nPotoff non-bonded\n\n---\n\nTitle: Atomistic Molecular Dynamics Simulations of Carbon ...\nURL: https://oar.princeton.edu/rt4ds/file/14706/Atomistic+Molecular+Dynamics+Simulations+of+Carbon+Dioxide+Diffusivity+in+n-Hexane%2C+n-Decane%2C+n-Hexadecane%2C+Cyclohexane%2C+and+Squalane.pdf\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: Moultos, Othon\nHighlights:\naccurate results, with deviations from the experimental data in the range 19% – 65%, and with \nan average absolute deviation (AAD) for all temperature and pressures approximately equal to \n28%.\n...\nexperimental data being less than 9% for all conditions\n\n---\n\nTitle: Toward realistic computer modeling of paraffin-based composite materials: critical assessment of atomic-scale models of paraffins\nURL: https://doi.org/10.1039/c9ra07325f\nPublished: 2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\nAuthor: Artyom D. Glova, Igor V. Volgin, Victor M. Nazarychev, Sergey V. Larin, Sergey V. Lyulin, Andrey A. Gurtovenko\nHighlights:\neld along with the experimental value 84 measured at T ¼ 453 K ... -UA) underestimate the shear viscosity. The closest match to the experimental data is observed for ... and GRO-MOS force elds, whose viscosities are 10% and 14% smaller than what was"
